<title>USA: Lyons Twp. HSD 204, Ill., won by Merrill Lynch.</title>
<headline>Lyons Twp. HSD 204, Ill., won by Merrill Lynch.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it won $10.875 million ofLyons Twp. HSD 204, Ill., general obligation limited tax school bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.517 percent.</p>
</text>
